out.push("\n\n### 6.2 JavaScript\n\n```javascript\nclass AccessibleAccordion extends HTMLElement {\n  connectedCallback() {\n    if (this.controller) return;\n\n    this.buttons = [...this.querySelectorAll(\n      'button[aria-expanded][aria-controls]'\n    )].filter(button =>\n      button.closest('accessible-accordion') === this\n    );\n\n    this.panels = this.buttons.map(button =>\n      document.getElementById(\n        button.getAttribute('aria-controls')\n      )\n    );\n\n    if (\n      !this.buttons.length ||\n      this.panels.some(panel =>\n        !panel || !this.contains(panel)\n      )\n    ) return;\n\n    this.controller = new AbortController();\n\n    const signal = this.controller.signal;\n\n    this.mode = this.getAttribute('mode') || 'multiple';\n\n    const firstOpen = this.buttons.findIndex(button =>\n      button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true'\n    );\n\n    this.buttons.forEach((button, i) => {\n      const expanded =\n        this.mode === 'multiple'\n          ? button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true'\n          : i === (\n              firstOpen === -1 &&\n              this.mode === 'required'\n                ? 0\n                : firstOpen\n            );\n\n      this.setExpanded(i, expanded);\n\n      button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        this.toggle(i);\n      }, { signal });\n    });\n  }\n\n  setExpanded(index, expanded) {\n    const button = this.buttons[index];\n    const panel = this.panels[index];\n\n    if (\n      !expanded &&\n      panel.contains(document.activeElement)\n    ) {\n      button.focus();\n    }\n\n    button.setAttribute(\n      'aria-expanded',\n      String(expanded)\n    );\n\n    panel.hidden = !expanded;\n\n    if (this.mode === 'required' && expanded) {\n      button.setAttribute('aria-disabled', 'true');\n    } else {\n      button.removeAttribute('aria-disabled');\n    }\n  }\n\n  toggle(index) {\n    const button = this.buttons[index];\n\n    const expanded =\n      button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';\n\n    if (this.mode === 'required' && expanded) {\n      return;\n    }\n\n    if (!expanded && this.mode !== 'multiple') {\n      this.buttons.forEach((_, i) => {\n        if (i !== index) {\n          this.setExpanded(i, false);\n        }\n      });\n    }\n\n    this.setExpanded(index, !expanded);\n  }\n\n  disconnectedCallback() {\n    this.controller?.abort();\n    this.controller = null;\n  }\n}\n\nif (!customElements.get('accessible-accordion')) {\n  customElements.define(\n    'accessible-accordion',\n    AccessibleAccordion\n  );\n}\n```\n\n三种模式分别使用：\n\n```html\n<accessible-accordion mode=\"multiple\">\n```\n\n```html\n<accessible-accordion mode=\"exclusive\">\n```\n\n```html\n<accessible-accordion mode=\"required\">\n```\n\nRequired 模式下，当前展开的面板不能关闭，所以对应按钮使用 `aria-disabled=\"true\"` 表达该操作暂时不可用。按钮仍然可以被聚焦，JavaScript 则负责阻止关闭行为。\n\n### 6.3 Accordion 与 Tabs 的键盘机制区别\n\n这是本节课的一个重点。\n\n");
